    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp; be the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>14</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>14</mn></msup></math> is equal to"
